  message: "Fixed in PR (auto-pr in flight). Root cause: Tauri IPC and wasm_bindgen linkers created edges with synthetic source IDs but never created corresponding Symbol nodes. Slicer BFS dead-ended on node_by_id.get(edge.src) returning None. Fix: both linkers now emit synthetic Symbol nodes (ipc_publisher, wasm_import) alongside edges, and registry wrappers pass symbols through."  # d2a7
